  "description": "An introduction to the snatch and the clean and jerk, three days a week for 10 weeks. The first block teaches the positions from the hang with light weights; the second moves to the full lifts from the floor; the last two weeks are heavier. Squats and pulls build the strength the lifts need. Learn from a coach if you can, and only add weight while every rep is fast and in the right position.",
